Back home, Byomkesh ordered tea. Satyabati brought in tea and potato chops. Thus, with refreshments and cigarettes, the consultation began.  

An hour later, Rakhalbabu said, ‘Very well, that’s settled. The police department will cover your expenses and such; I’ll see to it. You’ll have confirmation by this evening.’  

